<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 27.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 27.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.Aksu (built 1988) 38,281 dwt del Canakkale prompt trip via Black Sea redel Karachi $10,000 daily Italmare.</p>
<p>Olympic Mentor 29,693 dwt built 1984 del USG 6-12/12 trip S'pore/Japan range $10,850 daily plus $60,000 bonus PanOcean.</p>
<p>Gill (built 1978) 16,318 dwt Del Tema 25-30/11 prompt redel USAC $3,000 daily Gernstar (amended).</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
